## UI/UX Standards & Documentation

**KANONICZNE ŹRÓDŁO:** `docs/ui-standards/README.md`

**⚠️ NIE WYMYŚLAJ NOWYCH STANDARDÓW ANI KOMPONENTÓW.** Wszystkie komponenty UI MUSZĄ być zgodne z dokumentacją w `docs/ui-standards/`. Jeśli standard nie opisuje przypadku — ZAPYTAJ, nie wymyślaj.

Before modifying any UI components:

1. **Read the documentation** — standards are in `docs/ui-standards/`:
   - `README.md` — index wszystkiego
   - `01-shell-layout/presentation-modes.md` — architecture D/N/C, N blocks kit
   - `02-components/shared-sections.md` — NModeSections (Comments, Activity, Risk, Governance, Attachments)
   - `02-components/building-blocks.md` — NModeBlocks (Callout, ToggleBlock, EmptyState, Checklist, InlineTable, EmbeddedView)

2. **Use shared components** — NEVER duplicate UI code:
   - `src/components/shared/NModeSections/` — CommentsCanvas, ActivityLogCanvas, AttachmentsLinksCanvas, RiskCanvas, GovernanceCanvas
   - `src/components/shared/NModeBlocks/` — Callout, ToggleBlock, EmptyStateInline, ChecklistBlock, InlineTable, EmbeddedView
   - `src/components/shared/NModeLayout/` — NModeShell, NModeHeader, NModeLeftNav, NModeCanvas, NModePropertiesStrip

3. **Follow naming conventions**: `{Section}Canvas.tsx` for shared sections
4. **Always support i18n**: PL + EN via `useTranslation`
5. **Always support locked state**: `locked?: boolean` prop for read-only artifacts

Detailed rules are in `.cursor/rules/nmode-shared-components.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/ui-standards-documentation.mdc`.

